autoApps.releaseNotes:
## Fixes
- Fix the alarm triggering issue introduced in version 2.32;
- Fix the creation of alarms from other apps (#713);
- Fix vibrations when the alarm is snoozed or dismissed;
- Fix the alarm mission display when clicking the _"Dismiss"_ button (#715);
- Fix the compact timer layout (#710):
  - The remaining time no longer overlaps the _"Reset"_ button;
  - The _"Reset"_ button now retains its rounded shape;
- Fix resetting expired timers by clicking on the timer circle (#711);
- Fix dialog icons for Right-to-Left languages;

## Improvements

### General
- Add the ability to display country flags next to city names (#709):
  - This applies to world cities, time zones, and the _"Digital clock"_ widget;
- Add the ability to customize the size of the floating action button
